\item OpenAI, \emph{QMA-hardness of continuum Coulomb energy with unit nuclear charges}, 2026-09-24; citation key \texttt{OAI:QMA-hardness-of-continuum-Coulomb-energy-with-unit-nuclear-charges-September-24-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/QMA-hardness-of-continuum-Coulomb-energy-with-unit-nuclear-charges-September-24-2026/QMA-hardness-of-continuum-Coulomb-energy-with-unit-nuclear-charges-September-24-2026.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/QMA-hardness-of-continuum-Coulomb-energy-with-unit-nuclear-charges-September-24-2026/QMA-hardness-of-continuum-Coulomb-energy-with-unit-nuclear-charges-September-24-2026.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/QMA-hardness-of-continuum-Coulomb-energy-with-unit-nuclear-charges-September-24-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/QMA-hardness-of-continuum-Coulomb-energy-with-unit-nuclear-charges-September-24-2026/QMA-hardness-of-continuum-Coulomb-energy-with-unit-nuclear-charges-September-24-2026.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/QMA-hardness-of-continuum-Coulomb-energy-with-unit-nuclear-charges-September-24-2026/build/introduction.tex\#L91}{thm:main}.
\item Family 275: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/275.md}{Lean scope}.
